dataset_of fingerprints the replayed jobs and bounds their observation; replay.monitor treats a
post-promotion run as evidence only when its fingerprint is not one the promotion was judged
on, its bounds pass the promotion, and whole days have been observed since -- and scores only
those days. Proposals record the simulator version and the dataset they were judged on.

